<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><office:document xmlns:office="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:office:1.0" xmlns:text="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:text:1.0" xmlns:table="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:table:1.0" office:version="1.3" office:mimetype="application/vnd.oasis.opendocument.text"><office:body><office:text><text:p># Review summary — fictional worked example</text:p><text:p>Review depth: full source and independent calculation check because public logistics affect travel, access, crowding and spending.</text:p><text:p>Decision: ACCEPT audit record; REVISE draft; STOP publication.</text:p><text:p>Unresolved owner: fictional event organizer. Parking availability/cost and volunteer contact/deadline remain unanswered. External publication: NOT PERFORMED.</text:p><text:p>Source record: numbered files in this kit. Changes: 150 → 120; 525 → 575 credits; restore audience and access qualifications; remove invented deadline and blanket confirmation.</text:p><text:p>Limitation: supplied evidence is incomplete. Improvement: obtain reliable answers, record source locations and rerun all affected checks before release.</text:p></office:text></office:body></office:document>
